<section class="module-landing-banner mb-5" style="--hero-bg: url('../images/home/hero-enterprise.jpg');" aria-label="Introduction">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="module-landing-accent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="module-landing-kicker mb-2">Logistics & Supply Chain</p>
        <h1 class="module-landing-headline text-white mb-3">Precision Fleet Management & Delivery Infrastructure.</h1>
        <p class="module-landing-dek mb-4 col-lg-10 px-0">
            Coordinate the movement of goods from origin to destination with surgical precision. 
            Automated scheduling, real-time tracking, and mobile integration for the modern supply chain.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <a href="#components" class="btn btn-light btn-sm px-4 fw-semibold">Module components</a>
            <a href="/#inquiry" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm px-4">Start a conversation</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="row mb-5" id="components">

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Module Components</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
            Our logistics platform integrates multiple specialized components into a unified command 
            and control system. Each tool is designed to address a critical friction point in the 
            delivery lifecycle.
        </p>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/logistics/commandcenter">Command Center</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    High-level live monitoring of all active trips, vehicles, and delivery statuses on 
                    a dynamic map interface. The primary hub for dispatchers and fleet managers.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/logistics/dashboard">Dashboard</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Strategic performance metrics (OTD, utilization, costs) and operational alerts aggregated 
                    into a single executive view for data-driven decision making.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/logistics/drivers">Driver Management</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Comprehensive driver profiles including licensing (PDP), medicals, and performance 
                    scoring. Integrated with EcoCash for swift driver advance disbursements.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/logistics/vehicles">Fleet Management</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Full lifecycle tracking of vehicles including service schedules, fuel consumption, 
                    inspection checklists, and regulatory renewal alerts.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/logistics/trips">Trip Scheduling</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    End-to-end management of delivery orders, from geocoded address verification to multi-stop 
                    consolidated load planning and vehicle capacity assignment.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/logistics/clients">Client Portal</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Dedicated visibility for your customers to track their deliveries in real-time, 
                    access digital proof of delivery (POD), and view historical shipping records.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/logistics/routeoptimization">Route Optimization</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Advanced sequencing algorithms that minimize distance and time across multi-stop 
                    runs, providing drivers with turn-by-turn navigation data.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/logistics/proofofdelivery">Proof of Delivery (POD)</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Digital confirmation of arrival via photo capture, recipient signature, and 
                    GPS-timestamping, integrated directly with the sales and accounts modules.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/logistics/analytics">Logistics Analytics</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Deep dive into delivery efficiency, cost per KM, fuel variance, and delivery 
                    success rates to identify areas for operational optimization.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Resilient Live Tracking</h2>
        <p>
            Visibility is the foundation of logistics. Our system utilizes specialized Android 
            foreground services and iOS background fetch protocols to maintain continuous 
            location streams from driver devices, even when the app is in the background 
            or the device is under heavy power management. This ensures that your Dispatch 
            Command Center has a truly accurate, real-time view of your fleet's position 
            and progress toward SLA targets.
        </p>
        <p>
            Geofencing alerts automatically notify the depot when a vehicle is returning for 
            reloading, and notify clients when their delivery is just minutes away, 
            significantly reducing idle time and communication friction.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Scientific Route & Load Planning</h2>
        <p>
            Maximize your fleet's capacity with intelligent load planning that accounts for 
            weight, volume, and vehicle constraints. Our route optimization engine 
            calculates the most efficient sequence for multi-stop deliveries, taking into 
            account local road conditions and turnaround times. By reducing total 
            kilometers traveled, our system directly lowers fuel expenditure and vehicle 
            wear-and-tear.
        </p>
        <p>
            Routes are wirelessly transmitted to the driver's mobile terminal, providing 
            them with a clear delivery manifest and turn-by-turn navigation instructions 
            optimized for heavy vehicles.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Frictionless Proof of Delivery</h2>
        <p>
            Eliminate paper-based delivery logs and reconciliation delays. Digital Proof of 
            Delivery (POD) captures recipient signatures, photographic evidence of goods 
            condition, and a precision GPS timestamp at the point of handover. Failed 
            deliveries are documented with specific reason codes (refused, not home, 
            wrong address), allowing for immediate rescheduling or investigation.
        </p>
        <p>
            Completed PODs are instantly attached to the corresponding sales order in the ERP, 
            triggering the next step in the accounting or invoicing workflow without manual 
            intervention.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-12 text-center">
        <p class="small mb-0">
            admin@pindah.org | +263 774 454 447
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
